# Voucher Validation Admin — frontend env template
#
# In production, Nginx proxies /api/* to the backend on the same origin,
# so VITE_API_URL stays unset and src/services/api.jsx falls back to "/api".
#
# In local dev, vite.config.js proxies /api → http://localhost:4001 so
# you don't need to set this either.
#
# Set this only if you want the frontend to talk to a backend on a
# different host (e.g. during testing against a remote API):
#   VITE_API_URL=https://vv.example.com/api
